{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>LoopCam 是一款利用 iPhone 相機進行 AR 動作偵測的運動次數計數工具。無論你是居家健身、車庫訓練還是獨自鍛鍊，只需將手機立好、走入畫面即可開始計數。目前這款實用工具正限時免費，原價 US $4.99。</p>\n\n<h2>相機 AR 運動計數</h2>\n<p>LoopCam 透過鏡頭辨識身體姿勢，在螢幕上繪製綠色骨架疊加層，即時顯示重複動作次數。支援手勢免觸控控制組數，並可錄製訓練過程供事後回顧。無論直向或橫向擺放，都能適應不同拍攝角度。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-121-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-122-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-123-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-124-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-125-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1284x2778bb-126-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<p>使用時需注意光線充足、全身入鏡，並避免多人同時訓練以確保準確性。LoopCam 並非醫療器材，也不保證動作姿勢正確性，但對於需要簡單計數又不願中途拿起手機的使用者來說，是非常方便的輔助工具。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：LoopCam: AR workout counter</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-23T07:19:29.025341+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":377,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}